[h1]TECZ | HUNTERMODS[/h1]
[b]ROLEPLAY • PVE • HARDCORE[/b]

A curated server-specific package for TECZ, a DayZ roleplay and hardcore PvE project. This Workshop item bundles licensed third-party modules for use in the TECZ environment, with all original creators credited below.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TecPlayBR/DayZ/main/TECZ/SteamWorkshop/assets/01-about.jpg[/img]
[h2]ABOUT THE PACKAGE[/h2]
[b]Package contents:[/b] 52 packaged PBO files, assembled from 44 mod products plus shared and compatibility components.
[b]Original creator:[/b] HunterMods / huntermods.
[b]Status:[/b] TECZ Season 1 in development.

[b]Please note:[/b] A module being included in this package does not guarantee that its mechanics, items, services or events are enabled on the server.

[h2]PACKAGE CONTENTS[/h2]
[h3]EVENTS & EXPLORATION[/h3]
[list]
[*] Air Drop Plus: configurable supply drops
[*] Ambulance Event: medical-themed encounters
[*] Bunker Event: bunker challenges and loot
[*] Camper Event: encounter around a camper vehicle
[*] Car Drop: configurable vehicle deliveries
[*] KOTH: zone-control event
[*] Locked Armory: timed locked-container encounter
[*] Loot Containers: configurable loot containers
[*] Secure the Zone: wave-based objective
[*] Toxic Event: hazardous-area event
[/list]

[h3]SURVIVAL, STORAGE & VEHICLES[/h3]
[list]
[*] Auto Gun Rack: weapon and equipment storage
[*] Auto Loadout: equipment loadout management
[*] Auto Storage: additional storage units
[*] Base Radio: persistence-related base protection mechanics
[*] Battery Charger Plus: expanded battery charging
[*] Bunker Hideout: underground shelter system
[*] Bunker Tunnels: tunnel-based base building
[*] Food and Drinks: additional consumables
[*] Improved Inventory: inventory utilities
[*] Improved Vehicles: vehicle inventory interactions
[*] Medical Plus: medical gameplay systems
[*] Storage Bank: virtual personal storage
[*] Vehicle Claim: vehicle ownership and protection
[*] Virtual Garage: vehicle storage
[/list]

[h3]CRAFTING, ITEMS & PROGRESSION[/h3]
[list]
[*] Advanced Printer: configurable 3D printing
[*] Craft Bench: configurable crafting recipes
[*] Gun Workbench: weapon management workstation
[*] Immersive Weapons: weapon maintenance mechanics
[*] Life Machines: coffee and other life-themed machines
[*] Mystery Boxes: configurable reward boxes
[*] PC Bitcoin: in-game mining equipment
[*] Recycler: item recycling
[*] Safezone Assets: decorative world assets
[*] Season Pass: experience and rewards progression
[*] Skin Manager: appearance management
[*] Speed Loader: magazine loading utilities
[*] Spin Gamble: configurable chance-based machine
[*] Vanilla Painting: item color customization
[/list]

[h3]SERVER UTILITIES[/h3]
[list]
[*] Advanced Logs: administrative activity records
[*] Advanced Teleports: configurable teleport destinations
[*] Country Filter: region-based access rules
[*] Improved Weapon Raise: obstruction-related handling
[*] Starter Kit: configurable starter equipment
[/list]

