Screenshots of the actual TECZ gameplay and individual systems will be shown in this Workshop item's image gallery as they are tested. Artwork and development previews do not represent a guarantee that a feature is active.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TecPlayBR/DayZ/main/TECZ/SteamWorkshop/assets/03-installation.jpg[/img]
[h2]INSTALLATION & REQUIREMENTS[/h2]
[list]
[*] Subscribe to the TECZ Workshop items required by the server.
[*] Use the official DayZ Launcher to join TECZ and manage the required Workshop dependencies.
[*] Do not assume that a module's presence means all its optional integrations are configured or enabled.
[*] For installation support, contact the official TECZ community.
[/list]

